 "title": "County Services | Cass County, MI",
 "text": "County Services | Cass County, MI\nLoading\nSkip to Main Content\nCreate a Website Account - Manage notification subscriptions, save form progress and more.\nWebsite Sign In\n-->\nBusiness\nServices\nGovernment\nVisitor Information\nSheriff's Office\nSearch\nHome\nServices\nCounty Services\nCass County aims to deliver the best services possible to its residents.\nTo learn more about what we have to offer, please visit the links provided below. For a complete list of our County Offices please click on this link to our Departments page for more information.\n9\n1\n2\n2\nCommunity Links\nBrowse through a collection of helpful community links to keep you connected.\nApply For\nApply for employment, licenses and permits.\nFind\nQuickly find important information and resources.\nRequest Records and Reports\nContact\nLearn how to contact our offices and officials.\nCounty Partners\nHazardous Waste & Used Tire Collection\nGrant and Loan Programs\nHours & Holidays\nCheck hours of operation and closures for Cass County offices.\nFacilities\nCheck out area parks, Animal Control, Medical Care Facility as well as other County operated facilities.\nCourt Information\nReview helpful court information.\nMaps\nPeruse maps created and maintained by our GIS department on the Beacon website.\nWeather Closures\nLearn about alternative sources to find out about inclement weather closures in the community.\nCommunity Links\nApplications & Forms\nCommunity News\nContact Us\nResource Guide\nApply For\nBoards & Commissions\nBuilding, Mechanical & Electrical Permit\nConcealed Pistol License (CPL)\nDog License\nDoing Business As (DBA) License\nEmergency Home Repair Grant\nJob Opportunities\nMarriage License\nNew Address\nNotary License\nFind\nBids & RFPs\nCass County\nElected Officials\nElection Results\nMy Polling Place\nParcel Locator\nHelpful Links\nInmate Status\nTownship / City / Village Info\nRequest Records and Reports\nBirth, Marriage & Death Records\nCourt Records\nFreedom o